\par }{\fs16\lang2057\langfe1031\langnp2057\insrsid7023795\charrsid7023795 The knights and the castles are prepared as well as they can be - the deciding battle over Losmodos Valley is approaching. 
\par 
\par There are 2 castles, home of 2 teams. Use your skill and cunning to lead your team to rightful victory, or bravely face defeat when the time has come. 
\par 
\par In this teamwork melee up to 12 players can take part, but we recommend teams of 3 players each side. Your objective is to destroy the office of the opponent party.
\par 
\par A little hint to help you get started: even a seemingly inferior team can win, if it employs the better strategy. Make sure that everyone in your team knows what they're doing and that the tasks are split equally.}{
